be caught and grounded in my home.

00:01:42.663 --> 00:01:44.996
This is the house where I grew up,

00:01:45.413 --> 00:01:52.038
although this is the longest I've been
here in one place since the age of, well,

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:58.038
18, I think. Wow. You know, here I have
all my work, all my books behind me.

